# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRINCE // WORLD — environment template
# Copy to .env.local (local) or configure in Vercel dashboard.
# Secrets NEVER reach the browser — server-side only.
# The world runs fully without any of these (graceful fallbacks).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── AI ORACLE (Groq) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Powers the NEURAL LINK chat + terminal `ask`/`narrate`.
# Get a key: https://console.groq.com/keys
# WARNING: never paste keys in chats/commits — Groq auto-revokes exposed keys.
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Optional model override (default: llama-3.3-70b-versatile)
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# GitHub — optional. Raises rate limit from 60/hr to 5000/hr.
# Public data only; grants no extra read access to private repos.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Spotify — optional. Enables Music District enrichment
# (favorite artist's public top tracks) via client-credentials.
# Real-time playback comes from Lanyard and needs NO credentials.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Riot — optional. Valorant rank/match adapter (production key
# required from Riot Developer Portal). Until set: standby state.
RIOT_API_KEY=

# Steam — optional. Public profile enrichment adapter.
STEAM_API_KEY=

# YouTube — optional. Channel integration adapter.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
